{"speciesId":763,"names":{"fr":"Sucreine","es":"Tsareena","en":"Tsareena","ja":"アマージョ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Spécialiste du coup de pied bien placé, ce Pokémon prend un malin plaisir à savater ses ennemis au sol en riant aux éclats."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Propinar patadas implacables es su especialidad. Patea a sus oponentes derrotados y proclama su victoria con una gran carcajada."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its long, striking legs aren’t just for show but to be used to kick with skill. In victory, it shows off by kicking the defeated, laughing boisterously."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"脚を 活かした 蹴りが 得意。 倒した 相手を 足蹴に して 高笑いで 勝利を アピール。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon est connu pour la forme parfaite de ses jambes. Les instituts de beauté n’hésitent pas à l’utiliser comme mascotte dans leurs pubs."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La belleza de sus piernas es bien conocida. Por eso no es de extrañar que se utilice como reclamo para salones de belleza y similares."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"A Pokémon known for the beauty of its well-shaped legs, it sometimes appears as a mascot in advertisements for beauty salons."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"美脚の ポケモンとして 知られ 美容クリニックなどの 広告の マスコットに なっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce véritable virtuose du coup de pied peut mettre K.O. un champion de kick-boxing en une seule frappe."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Propina bellas patadas con elegancia. Una sola bastaría para dejar fuera de combate a un campeón de kickboxing."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A master of grand and beautiful kicks, it can knock out even kickboxing champions with a single blow."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"美しい 蹴り技の 使い手。 キックボクシングの チャンピオンも 一撃で ノックアウトするぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon bagarreur possède un jeu de jambes hors du commun. Il éclate de rire entre chaque coup de pied qu’il assène à sa victime."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Es un Pokémon combativo y especialista en propinar patadas. Suelta una risotada cada vez que acierta al oponente."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A Pokémon with an aggressive personality and a mastery of kicking, it cackles every time it kicks an opponent."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"攻撃的な 気質の ポケモンで キックの 名手。 相手を 蹴り上げるたび 高笑いする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon au cœur cruel est redouté, car il piétine ses ennemis avec ses longues jambes sans aucune pitié."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sus piernas son tan esbeltas como cruel es su corazón. Un temible Pokémon que pisotea sin piedad al rival."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This feared Pokémon has long, slender legs and a cruel heart. It shows no mercy as it stomps on its opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"すらりと 伸びた 脚と 残忍な 心を もち 恐れられている。 敵を 容赦なく 踏みにじる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon frappe violemment ses ennemis de la pointe dure de ses jambes, ce qui leur inflige des dégâts irréversibles au corps et à l’âme."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Propina patadas con sus duras y puntiagudas piernas, con las que deja heridas indelebles en el cuerpo y el corazón del adversario."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"A kick from the hardened tips of this Pokémon’s legs leaves a wound in the opponent’s body and soul that will never heal."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"硬く 尖った つま先で 蹴りを おみまいして 相手の 体と 心に 消えない 傷を 残す。"}],"varieties":[{"id":763,"moves":[{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29],[20,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machin